OL,3,AGive more people weight-loss jabs on
OL,4,Athe NHS, say MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands more people
OL,7,Fshould be given access to the
OL,8,Fweight-loss injection Mounjaro on the
OL,9,FNHS in England, a cross-party group of
OL,10,FMPs says.
OL,12,FThe Health Committee said the current
OL,13,Fplan for 220,000 people to have this
OL,14,Fjab for free on prescription in 2028
OL,15,Fwas a "woefully small number" and
OL,16,F"unambitious".
OL,18,FThis represents only around 6% of
OL,19,Feligible people and is a key reason why
OL,20,Fmore than a million have been paying
OL,21,Fprivately for weight-loss injections,
OL,22,Fincluding Mounjaro and Wegovy.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
