OL,3,AGive more people weight-loss jabs on
OL,4,Athe NHS, say MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee says a two-tier system is
OL,7,Femerging in which only the wealthy can
OL,8,Fget good access to the medication that
OL,9,Fcurbs appetite.
